msgid "勾选需要参与运行的卡片并点击 ``Run``。"
msgstr "Select the cards to run, then click ``Run``."

#: ../../source/index.rst:27 132df7a53d8440c383d272f971f48e53
msgid "在工作区检查每张卡的输入、参数和输出数量。"
msgstr "Check each card's inputs, parameters, and output count in the workspace."

#: ../../source/index.rst:29 84d19bd7d86f4582a2186dfe6d41253b
msgid "下面是一张 ``Lattice Strain`` 卡配置后的样子。它会对输入结构施加一组受控晶格应变， 适合用来补弹性响应附近的数据。"
msgstr ""
"The example below shows a configured ``Lattice Strain`` card. It applies a "
"controlled set of cell strains and is useful for adding structures near the "
"elastic-response regime."

#: ../../source/index.rst:32 4b94f03ad29f4ce98c9e273639bcdaaa
msgid "Lattice Strain card annotated quickstart"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:32 4b94f03ad29f4ce98c9e273639bcdaaa
