msgstr "The four highlighted areas correspond to a typical inspection:"

#: ../../source/index.rst:54 6512d1f78f2746868d500075751a2d87
msgid "打开候选结构、训练结构或训练结果目录。"
msgstr "Open a candidate pool, training set, or training-results directory."

#: ../../source/index.rst:55 65f99f0b72844a899f59859bfac817f9
msgid "看预测值、误差或分布，先定位最明显的问题。"
msgstr ""
"Use predictions, errors, or distributions to locate the most obvious "
"problems first."

#: ../../source/index.rst:56 62a3cb2210c34ba0b472bba8d1d6a42e
msgid "直接查看对应结构，判断它是不是坏构型、边界情况或训练集缺口。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect the corresponding geometry to decide whether it is a bad "
"configuration, an intended boundary case, or evidence of a dataset gap."

#: ../../source/index.rst:57 da74721f654b4d62a010ce3074d5bdef
msgid "用标签、搜索和选择功能把这些结构单独标出来，再导出或删除。"
msgstr ""
"Use tags, search, and selection tools to isolate those structures before "
"exporting or deleting them."

#: ../../source/index.rst:59 8f4d910aac934c9fb5fe1afca12d3175
msgid "更细的按钮说明见 :doc:`module/show-nep-reference`。"
msgstr "See :doc:`module/show-nep-reference` for a button-by-button reference."

#: ../../source/index.rst:61 8f239413474a4659866d24f2d352ebae
msgid "一条更真实的路线通常是："
msgstr "A realistic end-to-end path is:"

#: ../../source/index.rst:63 ee27e4786e34408e8f1cc2461c7e4cbd
msgid ""
"Make Dataset 生成候选结构\n"
"→ NEP Dataset Display 查看并清洗异常结构\n"
"→ FPS Filter 或其他方法选择代表结构\n"
"→ DFT 标注能量、力、应力\n"
"→ GPUMD 训练 NEP\n"
"→ NEP Dataset Display 回看训练结果并继续迭代"
msgstr ""
"Make Dataset: generate candidate structures\n"
"→ NEP Dataset Display: inspect candidates and remove unphysical structures\n"
"→ FPS Filter or another selector: choose representative structures\n"
"→ DFT: label energies, forces, and stresses\n"
"→ GPUMD: train the NEP model\n"
"→ NEP Dataset Display: inspect the trained model and start the next iteration"

#: ../../source/index.rst:73 7c4e6721e91c4a4eac64931b8138d702
msgid "从哪里开始"
msgstr "Where to start"

#: ../../source/index.rst:78 989ceb317b194e1e9c651efa6d267427
msgid "我想先跑通一次"
msgstr "Run the software once"

#: ../../source/index.rst:82 624eeee00e874856be9e08a227f6231d
msgid "从安装、启动到生成候选结构，并理解为什么要先清洗再 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"Install and launch NepTrainKit, generate a first candidate set, and "
"understand why cleaning comes before DFT."

#: ../../source/index.rst:84 e13492b8bdef4d3290eaada142e5724c
msgid "我想清洗候选结构"
msgstr "Clean candidate structures"

#: ../../source/index.rst:88 525e026c61f044ee834a74ac29b85ca8
msgid "从 Make Dataset 输出候选池，到 NEP Dataset Display 删除异常结构，再采样去 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"Take a pool from Make Dataset, remove problematic structures in NEP Dataset "
"Display, then sample representatives for DFT."

#: ../../source/index.rst:90 424c4da6108942c2a673cebe8d2ed5f7
msgid "我想分析已有训练结果"
msgstr "Analyze an existing training run"

#: ../../source/index.rst:94 1cb5f786b5604b9e9bd203c004bcb8b3
msgid "加载训练结构或训练结果，看误差、筛异常、导出子集。"
msgstr ""
"Load training structures or results, inspect errors, isolate unusual "
"structures, and export a subset."

#: ../../source/index.rst:96 418968a27c4e4cf398300ca5a7a3bcd7
msgid "我想系统扩充训练集"
msgstr "Expand a training set systematically"

#: ../../source/index.rst:100 6e03579399b74019993611fedc9f9fb3
msgid "按物理目的生成候选结构，然后接入清洗和采样流程。"
msgstr ""
"Generate candidates for a specific physical objective, then connect them to "
"the cleaning and sampling workflow."

#: ../../source/index.rst:102 c9321c8dfccf4312ba9552b7db7df39d
msgid "我想写自己的卡片"
msgstr "Create a custom card"

#: ../../source/index.rst:106 9d045525b3024a12b246077bf0d2234d
msgid "把已有脚本封装成 Make Dataset 卡片，供团队复用。"
msgstr "Package an existing script as a reusable Make Dataset card for the team."

#: ../../source/index.rst:109 1f3a5541248a4a8d9c2460dae8217dc3
msgid "安装提示"
msgstr "Installation note"

#: ../../source/index.rst:111 aaf6ea47e62a4f5eb68ab6accad9d12b
msgid ""
"使用 ``pip`` 安装时会自动检测 CUDA。若检测到可用 CUDA，将构建 GPU backend； 否则构建 CPU "
"backend。如需手动指定 CUDA，请在安装前设置 ``CUDA_HOME`` 或 ``CUDA_PATH``。完整命令见 "
":doc:`quickstart`。"
msgstr ""
"A ``pip`` installation detects CUDA automatically. It builds the GPU backend"
" when a usable CUDA installation is found and otherwise builds the CPU "
"backend. To select CUDA explicitly, set ``CUDA_HOME`` or ``CUDA_PATH`` "
"before installing. See :doc:`quickstart` for the complete commands."

